# MiniProject 1 Plan

I want to compare word frequencies between Arthur Conan Doyle and H. G. Wells.

I plan to use two books from each author from Project Gutenberg:
- The Adventures of Sherlock Holmes
- The Hound of the Baskervilles
- The Time Machine
- The War of the Worlds

I’ll clean the text, remove common stop words, and compare normalized word frequencies so the different book lengths do not skew the results.

I want to see if there are words that one author uses noticeably more often than the other.
